  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nLUXURY 3 BEDROOM DETACHED TWO-STOREY RESIDENCE\nCASTLEPLUNKETT, CO. ROSCOMMON\nF45 XD53\n\nWALKING DISTANCE OF CASTLEPLUNKETT VILLAGE\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this attractive three-bedroom detached two-storey residence, ideally situated on the outskirts of Castleplunkett Village, Co. Roscommon.\n\nPresented in good condition throughout, the property offers comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation over two floors and would make an ideal family home.\n\nA particular advantage is the ground-floor bedroom, providing flexible accommodation which could also lend itself to use as a home office, playroom or additional living space if desired.\n\nExternally, the residence is complemented by landscaped gardens to both the front and rear, with mature boundary hedging and fencing providing definition and privacy.\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent village location within walking distance of Castleplunkett and immediately convenient to the local national school.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGROUND FLOOR\n\n• Living Room\n• Kitchen\n• Back Kitchen / Utility\n• Bedroom 1\n\nFIRST FLOOR\n\n• Bedroom 2\n• Bedroom 3\n• Bathroom\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nThe property stands on an attractive site with landscaped gardens to the front and rear.\n\nBoundary hedging and fencing are in place along the sides and rear of the property, creating a well-defined and private residential setting.\n\nGENERAL FEATURES\n\n• 3 bedroom detached two-storey residence\n• Ground-floor bedroom\n• Presented in good condition throughout\n• Landscaped front and rear gardens\n• Boundary hedging and fencing\n• PVC windows and doors\n• Walking distance of Castleplunkett Village\n• Convenient to Castleplunkett National School\n• Attractive countryside setting with village amenities close at hand\n• Eircode: F45 XD53\n\nVIEWING\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented three-bedroom home in a convenient location on the outskirts of Castleplunkett Village.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the Sole Selling Agents.\n\nFor further particulars or to arrange a viewing, contact:\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel: 086 213 0723\n\nOffice: 094 936 2216\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nDISCLAIMER\n\nThese particulars, including measurements, distances, services and descriptions, are provided for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. The agents have not tested any services, appliances or equipment, and intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided.",
